<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mail</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>mail &lt;letter&gt; &lt;player&gt;
request
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>mail paper asta
request
eat letter
</pre>
<p>The mail command sends a letter to another player, in the game or not. It only 
works at a post office, with the postman there: Jim in Midgaard, or Hansen in 
Udgaard. Write your letter first (see <a cmd='#'>Help Write</a>), then give it to the postman 
with mail, the paper and the player's name. He adds who it's from and the date.
</p><p>When mail has come for you, you get "a sudden urge to visit the post office" 
when you log on. Go to a postman and type <a cmd='#'>request</a> to get your letters. A 
mailbox holds 100 letters; when it's full, nothing more can be sent to it. To 
throw away a letter you have read, eat it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Write</a>
</pre>




</div>